{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"runkin_archer","model_identifier":"runkin_archer","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"# runkin_archer\n\nRunkin archer (A2), main fighter, 1.5 m = 53 u (hood to 55).\n\nRunkin hunter-warrior: stitched, laced hide armour with hide shoulder guards and a bracer on the bow arm, hide hood and short hide cape, fringed kilt over leggings, a Runkin recurve bow and a hide quiver on the right hip. Can shoot while walking (walk_shoot). Baseline skeleton and slot names; gear are preview groups inside the slots.\n\n- Cubes: 40 (all unrotated unless noted). Texture 128x64, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Rest bounds (body, no held items): x -9.2..9.2, y 0.0..54.5, z -5.0..5.0 (faces -Z).\n\n## Hit box\n\n- one box 16 x 55 x 12 (w x h x d), centred on x = 0, z = 0, from y = 0\n\n## Clips\n\n| clip | length (s) | loop | notes |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `shoot` | 1.3 | once | key 0.82 s: arrow leaves the string (raise 0-0.3, draw to 0.7, loose) |\n| `idle` | 3.4 | loop | bow lowered in the left hand |\n| `walk` | 0.85 | loop |  |\n| `run` | 0.52 | loop |  |\n| `walk_shoot` | 1.9 | loop | loop 1.9 s, key 1.1281 s: arrow leaves the string; legs walk throughout, then the right hand fetches a new arrow from the hip quiver and re-nocks (one shot per loop) |\n| `injured` | 0.5 | once | flinch from the front |\n| `death` | 1.3 | hold | falls on the back, holds; rests on y = 0 |\n\n## Move speeds (in-place cycles; stride matched to these)\n\n- `walk`: 46.2 u/s (1.30 m/s), cycle 0.85 s\n- `run`: 142.2 u/s (4.00 m/s), cycle 0.52 s\n- `walk_shoot`: 32.0 u/s (0.90 m/s), 2 strides per loop (1.9 s)\n\n## Key times\n\n- `shoot`: key 0.82 s: arrow leaves the string (raise 0-0.3, draw to 0.7, loose)\n- `walk_shoot`: loop 1.9 s, key 1.1281 s: arrow leaves the string; legs walk throughout, then the right hand fetches a new arrow from the hip quiver and re-nocks (one shot per loop)\n\n## Attachment points (empty groups, pivot in model units)\n\n- `slot_head` on `head` at (0, 53, 0)\n- `slot_back` on `torso` at (0, 37, 4.5)\n- `slot_quiver` on `torso` at (2.5, 40, 4.5)\n- `slot_shoulder_r` on `torso` at (4, 44.5, 0)\n- `slot_carry` on `torso` at (0, 35.5, -4.5)\n- `slot_hand_r` on `hand_r` at (7, 22.5, 0)\n- `slot_shield_l` on `arm_lower_l` at (-10, 28.75, 0)\n- `slot_hand_l` on `hand_l` at (-7, 22.5, 0)\n- `slot_hip_r` on `hips` at (6, 29, 2.5)\n- `slot_hip_l` on `hips` at (-6, 29, 2.5)\n\n## Preview / carried items in slots\n\n- `recurve_bow` (visible, under slot_hand_l): about 1.2 m (43 u) tip to tip, bone-tipped recurved ends, grip at the origin, limbs along Z, string on the +Y side\n- `hide_quiver` (visible, under slot_hip_r): fringed hide quiver with fletched arrows (the hand reaches here in walk_shoot)\n\n## Notes\n\n- No arrow is modelled on the string; spawn the projectile at slot_hand_r / the bow at the key time.\n- walk_shoot: drive root forward at the walk_shoot speed; the feet are planted for that speed.\n"},"description":"# runkin_archer\n\nRunkin archer (A2), main fighter, 1.5 m = 53 u (hood to 55).\n\nRunkin hunter-warrior: stitched, laced hide armour with hide shoulder guards and a bracer on the bow arm, hide hood and short hide cape, fringed kilt over leggings, a Runkin recurve bow and a hide quiver on the right hip. Can shoot while walking (walk_shoot). Baseline skeleton and slot names; gear are preview groups inside the slots.\n\n- Cubes: 40 (all unrotated unless noted). Texture 128x64, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Rest bounds (body, no held items): x -9.2..9.2, y 0.0..54.5, z -5.0..5.0 (faces -Z).\n\n## Hit box\n\n- one box 16 x 55 x 12 (w x h x d), centred on x = 0, z = 0, from y = 0\n\n## Clips\n\n| clip | length (s) | loop | notes |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `shoot` | 1.3 | once | key 0.82 s: arrow leaves the string (raise 0-0.3, draw to 0.7, loose) |\n| `idle` | 3.4 | loop | bow lowered in the left hand |\n| `walk` | 0.85 | loop |  |\n| `run` | 0.52 | loop |  |\n| `walk_shoot` | 1.9 | loop | loop 1.9 s, key 1.1281 s: arrow leaves the string; legs walk throughout, then the right hand fetches a new arrow from the hip quiver and re-nocks (one shot per loop) |\n| `injured` | 0.5 | once | flinch from the front |\n| `death` | 1.3 | hold | falls on the back, holds; rests on y = 0 |\n\n## Move speeds (in-place cycles; stride matched to these)\n\n- `walk`: 46.2 u/s (1.30 m/s), cycle 0.85 s\n- `run`: 142.2 u/s (4.00 m/s), cycle 0.52 s\n- `walk_shoot`: 32.0 u/s (0.90 m/s), 2 strides per loop (1.9 s)\n\n## Key times\n\n- `shoot`: key 0.82 s: arrow leaves the string (raise 0-0.3, draw to 0.7, loose)\n- `walk_shoot`: loop 1.9 s, key 1.1281 s: arrow leaves the string; legs walk throughout, then the right hand fetches a new arrow from the hip quiver and re-nocks (one shot per loop)\n\n## Attachment points (empty groups, pivot in model units)\n\n- `slot_head` on `head` at (0, 53, 0)\n- `slot_back` on `torso` at (0, 37, 4.5)\n- `slot_quiver` on `torso` at (2.5, 40, 4.5)\n- `slot_shoulder_r` on `torso` at (4, 44.5, 0)\n- `slot_carry` on `torso` at (0, 35.5, -4.5)\n- `slot_hand_r` on `hand_r` at (7, 22.5, 0)\n- `slot_shield_l` on `arm_lower_l` at (-10, 28.75, 0)\n- `slot_hand_l` on `hand_l` at (-7, 22.5, 0)\n- `slot_hip_r` on `hips` at (6, 29, 2.5)\n- `slot_hip_l` on `hips` at (-6, 29, 2.5)\n\n## Preview / carried items in slots\n\n- `recurve_bow` (visible, under slot_hand_l): about 1.2 m (43 u) tip to tip, bone-tipped recurved ends, grip at the origin, limbs along Z, string on the +Y side\n- `hide_quiver` (visible, under slot_hip_r): fringed hide quiver with fletched arrows (the hand reaches here in walk_shoot)\n\n## Notes\n\n- No arrow is modelled on the string; spawn the projectile at slot_hand_r / the bow at the key time.\n- walk_shoot: drive root forward at the walk_shoot speed; the feet are planted for that speed.\n","resolution":{"width":128,"height":128},"elements":[{"name":"pelvis","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-5.0,26.0,-3.0],"to":[5.0,30.0,3.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,26.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[30,61,40.0,65.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[50,61,56.0,65.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[40,61,50.0,65.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[56,61,62.0,65.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[92,54,102.0,60.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[102,54,112.0,60.0],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"37d92714-756d-51b9-8f7f-9c6a70e81af1"},{"name":"chest","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-5.5,30.0,-3.0],"to":[5.5,43.0,3.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,30.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[2,0,13.0,13.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[24,0,30.0,13.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[13,0,24.0,13.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[30,0,36.0,13.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[70,54,81.0,60.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[81,54,92.0,60.0],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"095b14f1-c817-553d-9425-fd88dbbcb719"},{"name":"neck","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-1.5,43.0,-1.5],"to":[1.5,45.0,1.5],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,43.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[28,74,31.0,76.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[31,74,34.0,76.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[34,74,37.0,76.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[37,74,40.0,76.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[37,71,40.0,74.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[40,71,43.0,74.0],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"c637a284-043d-52d1-8f52-fb9db4e96c00"},{"name":"head","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-3.5,45.0,-3.5],"to":[3.5,53.0,3.5],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,43.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"